<title>FRANCE: Paribas to buy Asia Equity Holdings.</title>
<headline>Paribas to buy Asia Equity Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas said it had agreed to buy Asia Equity Holdings from 70 percent owner Securities One and 30 percent owner First Asia Securities.</p>
<p>It did not give financial details.</p>
</text>
